<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.56%				    O/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.12%				    T/N = 3.78%</p>
<p>		   Oct 16, 1996			Oct 15, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.77%	1 month forward =  5.12%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.63%	2 month forward =  5.97%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.05%	3 month forward =  7.17%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.76%	4 month forward =  7.93%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.19%	5 month forward =  8.26%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.36%	6 month forward =  8.47%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
